[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10620.87, "timestamp": "02:57:00", "text": "あなたは非常に広い影響力と人脈を持っていますね。何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10629.429, "timestamp": "02:57:09", "text": "私は、私は、私は、私は孤独です。私は私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10631.83, "timestamp": "02:57:11", "text": "どういう意味ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10634.71, "timestamp": "02:57:14", "text": "つまり、あなたが話しているのは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10637.269, "timestamp": "02:57:17", "text": "協力した。どうやってそうなるのかさえわからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10644.07, "timestamp": "02:57:24", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10646.55, "timestamp": "02:57:26", "text": "でも、たとえ私が協力したとしても"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10651.014, "timestamp": "02:57:31", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you dayo if they come that mean they do want to know ya"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10651.19, "timestamp": "02:57:31", "text": "人々にとって、それらは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10654.15, "timestamp": "02:57:34", "text": "離職率や"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10656.95, "timestamp": "02:57:36", "text": "何でも。離職率とは、私が得るものです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10659.59, "timestamp": "02:57:39", "text": "購読者数を増やすだけで、視聴者数も増えます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10661.67, "timestamp": "02:57:41", "text": "彼らと協力する。いいえ、そうではありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10664.389, "timestamp": "02:57:44", "text": "私の場合は、そのようにうまくいきました。私は気づきました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10667.19, "timestamp": "02:57:47", "text": "たとえ私が大物とコラボレーションしたとしても"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10668.365, "timestamp": "02:57:48", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yup"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10670.15, "timestamp": "02:57:50", "text": "ストリーマーとかは関係ない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10677.75, "timestamp": "02:5